    "turn_id": "d09_unique_value:r5:t5",
    "narration": "Iris is quiet for a moment. The sparse room offers little distraction — two bare beds, empty wardrobes, empty cabinets — so the silence has nowhere to hide.\n\n\"I don't know,\" she says. \"I haven't — there isn't a usual way I do that. Not one I can describe.\"\n\nShe brushes a thumb across her own knuckles, then looks at the bare wall beyond the nearest bed.\n\n\"Ask me again when I've disagreed with someone close. Then I'll tell you how it went.\"",
